/**

@brief BH ARC firmware tests
@defgroup tests_bh_arc BH ARC firmware
@ingroup all_tests
@details
The ARC management firmware runs power, clock, thermal and fan control for the chip. It
also handles the message queue that receives requests from the other controllers, and
keeps the GDDR calibration table. The tests in this area cover those functions, split by
the part of the firmware under test.
@{
@}

@defgroup tests_bh_arc_msgqueue Message queue
@ingroup tests_bh_arc
@details
The message queue that dispatches incoming firmware requests to their handlers. The tests
check the reply for each request type, including voltage, clock, flash, PCIe and telemetry
commands.
@{
@}

@defgroup tests_bh_arc_smbus SMBus target
@ingroup tests_bh_arc
@details
The SMBus target interface through which the management controller sends commands and
reads telemetry. The tests check command validation, read and write transfers, and the
error count.
@{
@}

@defgroup tests_bh_arc_aiclk AICLK power management
@ingroup tests_bh_arc
@details
AICLK power management, which sets the AI clock target from the enabled min and max
arbiters and any fmax limit. The tests check arbiter selection, clamping, bitmasks and the
AICLK messages.
@{
@}

@defgroup tests_bh_arc_gddr GDDR
@ingroup tests_bh_arc
@details
GDDR memory power control, carried out through the MRISC message register. The tests check
the power-on and power-off messages, and the error returns when the register is busy or
does not respond.
@{
@}

@defgroup tests_bh_arc_fan Fan control
@ingroup tests_bh_arc
@details
Fan control, which maps the ASIC and GDDR temperatures to a fan speed percentage with
hysteresis on the GDDR input. The tests check the curve and that its output stays within
bounds.
@{
@}

@defgroup tests_bh_arc_vf Voltage-frequency curve
@ingroup tests_bh_arc
@details
The voltage-frequency curve used to convert between a voltage and the frequency it
supports. The tests check the message handlers and that converting a frequency to a
voltage and back returns a value close to the start.
@{
@}

@defgroup tests_bh_arc_cat Thermal trip
@ingroup tests_bh_arc
@details
Thermal trip monitoring for GDDR, which trips on sustained over-temperature or on an
immediate critical reading. The tests check the dwell timing and the behaviour when the
thresholds are zero.
@{
@}

@defgroup tests_bh_arc_gddr_cal GDDR calibration table
@ingroup tests_bh_arc
@details
The GDDR calibration table, stored in two alternating flash banks that carry sequence
numbers and checksums. The tests check writes, reads, and recovery from damaged or
interrupted writes.
@{
@}

*/
